Dear All,

On a different note, could you please confirm that the various
versions of the CDF files have no impact on the actual mapping of data
to annotations?  I am working on a MoGene 1.0 dataset where a
diferentially expressed gene (confirmed by PCR) does not show up as
such on the array, so I would like to be 100% certain there is no
possibility of misalignment.

Regards,

_Taku

