Unfortunately, I don't understand what is exactly meant with these cryptic messages....
Of note: the number of 28869 units exactly correspond to the number of 'transcript_cluster_id's defined by Affymetrix in their file 'HuGene-1_0-st-v1.r4.mps'.

Nevertheless, we continued with the newly build CDF file, and tried to create an CDF environment out of it using the library 'makecdfenv'. However, this took quite some time (~30mins) and then it failed:
> make.cdf.package(file="hugene10stv1.cdf", author="Guido", maintainer="Guido <Gu...@wur.nl>"
+ , version="2.1.0", species="Homo_sapiens")
